.SH "نام (NAME)"
deb\-prerm \- package pre\-removal maintainer script
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBDEBIAN/prerm\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
A package can perform several pre\-removal actions via maintainer
scripts, by including an executable \fIprerm\fR file in its control
archive (i.e. \fIDEBIAN/prerm\fR during package creation).
.PP
The script can be called in the following ways:
.IP "\fIprerm\fR \fBremove\fR" 4
.IX Item "prerm remove"
Before the package is removed.
.IP "\fIold\-prerm\fR \fBupgrade\fR \fInew\-version\fR" 4
.IX Item "old-prerm upgrade new-version"
Before an upgrade.
.IP "\fInew\-prerm\fR \fBfailed\-upgrade\fR \fIold\-version\fR \fInew\-version\fR" 4
.IX Item "new-prerm failed-upgrade old-version new-version"
If the above \fBupgrade\fR fails.
.Sp
The \fInew\-version\fR is passed only since dpkg 1.18.5.
.IP "\fIprerm\fR \fBdeconfigure\fR \fBin\-favour\fR \fInew\-package\fR \fInew\-version\fR" 4
.IX Item "prerm deconfigure in-favour new-package new-version"
.PD 0
.IP "\ \ \ \ [ \fBremoving\fR \fIold\-package\fR \fIold\-version\fR ]" 4
.IX Item " [ removing old-package old-version ]"
.PD
Before package is deconfigured while dependency is replaced due to conflict.
.IP "\fIprerm\fR \fBremove\fR \fBin\-favour\fR \fInew\-package\fR \fInew\-version\fR" 4
.IX Item "prerm remove in-favour new-package new-version"
Before the package is replaced due to conflict.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBdpkg\fR\|(1).
